e testimonial layout</h2><p class=\"mb-8\">Example copy only, not customer endorsements.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><blockquote class=\"rounded-xl border p-6\"><p>Replace this sample quotation with an authorized customer quote.</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Sample person A</p></blockquote><blockquote class=\"rounded-xl border p-6\"><p>This is placeholder copy for demonstrating repeated blocks.</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Sample person B</p></blockquote></div></section>"},{"name":"image-text","label":"Image and text (HTML)","code":"<section class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 p-8 bg-white\"><img src=\"/sample.jpg\" alt=\"Choose your product photograph\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Designed for everyday use</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-600\">Editable text and an image picker, without a JavaScript framework.</p><a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"inline-block bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-lg px-6 py-3 mt-6\">Explore the collection</a></div></section>"}]